{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forest is a multiplayer first-person shooter with an emphasis on realism. This game has a minimum of casual aspects, you won't see the usual crosshair in the center of the screen, health and ammo counter.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/GamePlay2.00_00_56_30.Still001.png?t=1743946457\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Everything is done so that the immersion is maximum <br> <br>Artificial intelligence is made at a high level, similar to FEAR, bots hear your movement and react to shooting in their direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/GamePlay2.00_01_32_29.Still002.png?t=1743946457\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two maps have been added to diversify the battle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/GamePlay2.00_01_26_22.Still003.png?t=1743946457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You hear bullets whistling over your head, you see smoke coming out of the barrel, which can give you away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/GamePlay2.00_01_30_10.Still005.png?t=1743946457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several funny mechanics have also been added, which you will see directly by playing this game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642600?t=1743946457","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/9400f1ea66b5d15310bd523239925a4659fd2821/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743946457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/3f1c8afee4e88c10f4f998b86b0f41980529a8c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743946457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/3f1c8afee4e88c10f4f998b86b0f41980529a8c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743946457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forest is a multiplayer first-person shooter with an emphasis on realism. This game has a minimum of casual aspects, you won't see the usual crosshair in the center of the screen, health and ammo counter.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/GamePlay2.00_00_56_30.Still001.png?t=1743946457\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Everything is done so that the immersion is maximum <br> <br>Artificial intelligence is made at a high level, similar to FEAR, bots hear your movement and react to shooting in their direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/GamePlay2.00_01_32_29.Still002.png?t=1743946457\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two maps have been added to diversify the battle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/GamePlay2.00_01_26_22.Still003.png?t=1743946457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You hear bullets whistling over your head, you see smoke coming out of the barrel, which can give you away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/GamePlay2.00_01_30_10.Still005.png?t=1743946457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several funny mechanics have also been added, which you will see directly by playing this game</p>","developers":["Ihor Lema"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/f052bbffd76fce4e15b348f28ffb189dcb0a754e/header.jpg?t=1743946457","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121730,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121730/movie480.mp4?t=1743946456","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121730/movie_max.mp4?t=1743946456"},"name":"Forest Game Trailer 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121730/2cfcb5e5e2def4c443e85d24a1f1c7c7bf9b5a8a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743946456","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121730/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743946456","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121730/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743946456"}}],"name":"Forest","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></